  "name": "Pad Thai Noodles",
  "subtitle": "Rice noodles with tofu, sprouts, lime, and peanuts",
  "description": "A savory-sour Thai noodle dish combining softened rice vermicelli, browned tofu, egg, fresh sprouts, and a lime-soy sauce.",
